&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: top; width: 203px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 7.2px; padding-right: 7.2px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・高付加価値セパレータの生産能力倍増&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; text-align: left; text-indent: -12px"&gt;・製品出荷までの各工程（抄紙～裁断～出荷）の完結&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 20.8px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 174.6px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 7.2px; padding-right: 7.2px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: left"&gt;事業所・拠点別在庫の最適化&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: middle; width: 203px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 7.2px; padding-right: 7.2px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 1px solid #000000; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
